---
title: Garlic Tomato Toast
servings: 2
tags: [breakfast, quick]
prep time: 5 minutes
cook time: 5 minutes
---

> A made-up recipe for the Self Watch test set.

Toast @bread{4%slices} in a #pan{} or toaster for ~{3%minutes}. -- until golden

Rub each slice with @garlic{1%clove} and top with @tomatoes{2} sliced thin.

== Finish ==

Drizzle with @olive oil{1%tbsp} and sprinkle with @salt and @black pepper{}.
